.TH MODEL\-MANAGEMENT\-TOOL 1 "August 2026" "model-management-tool 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
model\-management\-tool \- AI model management tool
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B model\-management\-tool
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B model\-management\-tool
is a desktop application built with Tauri for managing AI models.
.PP
It supports importing local model files and directories, generating
local model package layouts, validating and rendering editable model
metadata, and downloading models from cloud repositories with resume
support.
.PP
This is a graphical application and accepts no command-line arguments.
